<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MERRY</span>: Semantically Decoupled Evaluation of <span id="id2" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">M</span>ultimodal <span id="id3" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">E</span>motional and <span id="id4" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">R</span>ole Consistencies of <span id="id5" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">R</span>ole-Pla<span id="id6" class="ltx_text ltx_underline">y</span>ing Agents</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_pubid"><span class="ltx_note_name">PubID: </span>pubid: 0000–0000/00$00.00 © 2021 IEEE</span></span></span>
